<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Ngoni Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ya Pauli kwa Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fil</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ya Pauli kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua yeniyi yihupi yiyandikwi na mtumi Pauli 1:1. Pauli ayiyandiki peavi muchifungu, lijambu leliganikiwa pangi avi pamulima wa Loma peayiyandikayi. Ndi ngati chakaka avi ku Loma peayandikayi, ndi yihotoleka neju yayandikwi mu mwaka 61 Yesu Kilisitu peamali kuvelekewa. Chitabu cha Vakolosai mewa chayandikwi mwaka wuwuwu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua iyi Pauli amuyandikili mundu mmonga mwaikemelewa Filimoni. Filimoni mu msambi wa vandu vavakumsadika Kilisitu mewa avi na vatumu vevakumuhengela. Pauli amuyandikili Filimoni balua iyi ndava ya kumuyupa akotoka kumupela mundu, Onesimo mvanda waki ndava kadeni amulimile. Kwa malagizu ga Chilumi Filimoni avi na uhotola wa kumukoma Onesimo. Pauli akumjovela Filimoni malovi gegana ukohakesu ndava ya kumkangamalisa mtima Filimoni amuyidakila Onesimo ngati mlongo waki mu Kilisitu, na hati ayidakiliwa kuvya muhenga lihengu pamonga na mwene Pauli (musula ya 1:13-14).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavi</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli akumjambusa Filimoni (musula ya 1:1-3).</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi Pauli akumuyupa Filimoni ndava ya Onesimo kuvya amuyidakilayi ngati mlongo waki mu Kilisitu (musula ya 1:4-21).</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli imalakisila balua yaki kwa kukokosa uganu waki wewamukitili amugendelelayi Filimoni na kumjambusa (musula ya 1:22-25).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1"/>Nene Pauli, mkungiwa ndava ya kumuhengela Yesu Kilisitu, pamonga na Timoti mlongo witu, tikuyandikila veve Filimoni, muhenga lihengu muyitu na nkozi muyitu mwatikuganili, <verse eid="PHM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2"/>na msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu vevikonganeka munyumba yaku, pamonga na mlumbu witu Afia, na manjolinjoli muyitu Alikipo.<verse eid="PHM 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3"/>Tikuvaganila uteke na ubwina kuhuma kwa Chapanga Dadi witu na Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="PHM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uganu na sadika ya Filimoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4"/>Lukumbi lwoha penimyupa Chapanga, nikukumbuka veve Filimoni na kumsengusa Chapanga, <verse eid="PHM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5"/>muni niyuwana chauyimili musadika kwa Bambu witu Yesu na uganu kwa vandu voha va Chapanga. <verse eid="PHM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6"/>Niyupa, kuvya kwinu musadika pamonga na veve, ukukita umanya kila chindu chabwina chetivili nachu mukuwungana na Bambu witu Kilisitu. <verse eid="PHM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7"/>Mlongo, uganu waku uletili luheku luvaha na kukangamalisa mtima neju! Na veve usangalwisi mitima ya vandu va Chapanga.<verse eid="PHM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luyupu ndava ya Onesimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8"/>Nene namlongo waku mukuwunga na Kilisitu nganihotwili kukulagiza changali wogohi ukita chauganikiwa kukita. <verse eid="PHM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9"/>Nambu ndava ya uganu, mbanga nikuyupe. Nikita chenichi pamonga nene Pauli mwanivii nagogo, na hinu mkungiwa ndava ya kumhengela Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="PHM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10"/>Hinu, nina luyupu kwaku kumvala Onesimo mweavili mwana vangu kwa kuwungana na Kilisitu. Muni navili dadi waki wa chimpungu petavili mchifungu. <verse eid="PHM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11"/>Pakutumbula apo avili lepi na lihengu kwaku nambu hinu ana lihengu kwa veve na nene mewa.<verse eid="PHM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12"/>Hinu nikumuwuyisa kwaku, pamonga nene nikumgana neju. <verse eid="PHM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13"/>Nigana atama na nene apa anitangatila pahala paku veve, lukumbi penivili mchifungu ndava ya kukokosa Lilovi la Bwina. <verse eid="PHM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14"/>Nikita lepi chindu chochoha changali kuyidakila veve. Naganili veve ubwela kwa kugana kwaku na lepi kwa kung'ang'aniswa.<verse eid="PHM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15"/>Pangi Onesimo awukili kwaku lukumbi lutali, muni uhotola kavili kuvya na veve magono goha. <verse eid="PHM 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16"/>Hinu mwene mvanda lepi kavili nambu mbwina kuliku mvanda. Mwene hinu ndi mlongo witu mganu. Ndi mbwina kwa nene na kwaku yati ivya mbwina neju, muni mwene ndi mundu ngati tete na mlongo witu mukuwungana na Bambu.<verse eid="PHM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17"/>Nambu, ukuniwona nene namuhenga lihengu muyaku hinu ndi mpokela Onesimo ngati ukunipokela nene. <verse eid="PHM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18"/>Ngati akubudili chindu, amala atolili chindu chaku, nene yati nikuwuyisila. <verse eid="PHM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19"/>Nene Pauli nikuyandikila kwa chiwoko changu namwene yati nikulipa. Kangi nigana lepi nikukumbusa kuvya veve una chindu cheuganikiwa kuniwuyisila ndi wumi waku. <verse eid="PHM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20"/>Hinu mlongo wangu, nikitila lijambu lenilo ndava ya Bambu, lisangalusa mtima wangu, ngati mlongo mukuwungana na Kilisitu.<verse eid="PHM 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21"/>Niyandika kuni nihuvalila kuvya yati wiyidakila luyupu lwangu, kavili nimanyili kuvya yati ukita hati neju ya ago genikuyupa. <verse eid="PHM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22"/>Pamonga na aga, nitendelekela chumba cha kugona, muni mukuyupa kwinu Chapanga, yati akuniwuyisa kavili kwinu.<verse eid="PHM 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jambusa ya kumalakisila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23"/>Epafla, mweakungiwi pamonga na nene ndava ya kumhengela Kilisitu Yesu, akukujambusa. <verse eid="PHM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24"/>Mewawa Maluko na Alistako na Dema na Luka, vahenga lihengu vayangu, vakuvajambusa.<verse eid="PHM 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25"/>Nikuvaganila mwavoha nyenye ubwina wa Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="PHM 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1"/>
</usx>
